395
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:16,376
* YOU WON'T GIVE UP ON ME *

396
00:21:18,110 --> 00:21:20,780
* I SHALL BELIEVE *

397
00:21:22,749 --> 00:21:26,285
* I SHALL BELIEVE *

398
00:21:28,254 --> 00:21:30,990
* I SHALL BELIEVE *

399
00:21:35,227 --> 00:21:36,529
DETECTIVE?
YEAH.

400
00:21:36,529 --> 00:21:37,530
