GET STARTED, OK?

408
00:22:04,424 --> 00:22:06,593
[HORN HONKS]

409
00:22:47,299 --> 00:22:48,501
[GASPS]

410
00:22:50,937 --> 00:22:52,572
AH. OH.

411
00:22:52,572 --> 00:22:56,108
[MAN YELLING]

412
00:22:56,108 --> 00:22:59,011
[WOMAN GASPING]

413
00:23:01,748 --> 00:23:03,616
