I'M JUST BULLSHITTIN' YOU.

450
00:25:36,803 --> 00:25:39,606
IT'S JUST THE KIND OF CRAP
PEOPLE LIKE TO HEAR.

451
00:25:49,215 --> 00:25:51,450
WAIT.

452
00:25:51,450 --> 00:25:52,451
WHAT ARE YOU DOIN'?

453
