00:26:46,773 --> 00:26:49,608
WAIT. LET'S NOT HURRY.

468
00:26:57,817 --> 00:26:59,251
NO, NO, NO, NO.
JUST LEAVE THAT--

469
00:26:59,251 --> 00:27:02,221
