JUST THAT. PLEASE.

470
00:27:03,389 --> 00:27:04,691
SURE.

471
00:27:26,679 --> 00:27:27,880
MMM.

472
00:27:31,450 --> 00:27:32,985
MMM. WHAT'S THE MATTER?

473
00:27:32,985 --> 00:27:35,321
