WE SLEEP TOGETHER?

478
00:27:41,060 --> 00:27:42,795
MMM, 'CAUSE
THE BED'S TOO SMALL.

479
00:27:42,795 --> 00:27:44,063
MMM, NO, IT'S NOT.

480
00:27:44,063 --> 00:27:46,465
MMM, COME ON, COME ON.
YOU GOTTA GO.

481
00:27:46,465 --> 00:27:48,167
HEY.

482
