[THUD]
OH!

483
00:27:49,401 --> 00:27:50,402
AH, JESUS.

484
00:27:56,508 --> 00:27:58,110
MMM.

485
00:28:00,847 --> 00:28:04,784
MMM. I'LL SEE YOU
TOMORROW. GOOD NIGHT.

486
