495
00:28:47,126 --> 00:28:48,394
BUT THAT WON'T BE MUCH HELP.

496
00:28:48,394 --> 00:28:50,229
YELLOW CARPET FIBERS,
CONSISTENT WITH

497
00:28:50,229 --> 00:28:52,431
A MASS-PRODUCED LINE
OF THE TRIACETATE VARIETY.

498
00:28:52,431 --> 00:28:54,600
MANUFACTURED OUT OF DENVER,
DISTRIBUTED ALL OVER

499
00:28:54,600 --> 00:28:55,734
THE WESTERN UNITED STATES

500
00:28:55,734 --> 00:28:58,070
UNDER SEVERAL DIFFERENT
BRAND NAMES.

501
00:28:58,070 --> 00:28:59,038
NO HELP.

502
00:28:59,038 --> 00:29:01,007
SAME WITH
THE RED FIBERS.

503
00:29:01,007 --> 00:29:03,642
SEVERAL LUSTROUS
TRILOBAL NYLON FIBERS

504
00:29:03,642 --> 00:29:07,046
ALONG WITH SEVERAL OTHER
RED DELUSTERED FIBERS

505
00:29:07,046 --> 00:29:08,680
WILL BE EXAMINED
AND MATCHED WITH THE BRANDS.

506
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:10,116
SOLD BY HANOVER SAMPSON

507
00:29:10,116 --> 00:29:13,052
FOR SEVERAL WHOLESALE
DISCOUNT STORES.

508
00:29:13,052 --> 00:29:13,853
OH.

509
00:29:13,853 --> 00:29:15,922
THAT NARROWS IT DOWN.

510
00:29:15,922 --> 00:29:19,191
THEY SOLD 50,000 OF THEM
IN THAT COLOR LAST YEAR.

511
00:29:19,191 --> 00:29:22,728
MICROSCOPIC EXAMINATION
OF THE CUTICLE, THE CORTEX,

512
00:29:22,728 --> 00:29:23,963
AND THE MEDULLA
OF THE HAIR

513
00:29:23,963 --> 00:29:26,065
WILL REVEAL THEM
TO BE HUMAN IN ORIGIN.

514
00:29:26,065 --> 00:29:27,266
2 BROWN HUMAN HEAD HAIRS.

515
00:29:27,266 --> 00:29:29,802
DEFINITELY NOT
THE VICTIM'S.

516
00:29:29,802 --> 00:29:31,804
Justin: ALL BUT ONE.

517
00:29:38,144 --> 00:29:39,311
THIS ONE
WILL BAFFLE THEM,

518
00:29:39,311 --> 00:29:41,047
BUT IT WILL ALL
MAKE SENSE LATER.

519
00:29:41,047 --> 00:29:42,849
ONE HAIR
OF NONHUMAN ORIGIN.

520
00:29:42,849 --> 00:29:44,150
SCALE PATTERN OF THE HAIR
MATCHES THAT

521
00:29:44,150 --> 00:29:46,052
OF CYNOCEPHALUS MAIMON.

522
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:49,956
IT'S A FREAKIN'
BABOON HAIR.

523
00:29:49,956 --> 00:29:52,892
NO FINGERPRINTS,
NO MURDER WEAPON.

524
00:29:52,892 --> 00:29:54,994
THEY'LL HAVE THEIR WORK
CUT OUT FOR THEM.

525
00:29:56,762 --> 00:29:59,365
THAT'S WHAT THEY'RE
PAID FOR, RIGHT?

526
00:29:59,365 --> 00:30:00,299
Sam: HERE IT IS.

527
00:30:00,299 --> 00:30:02,101
CORONER SAID
STRANGULATION WAS SLOW,

528
00:30:02,101 --> 00:30:05,004
PERHAPS THE VICTIM
WAS BEING TORTURED.

529
00:30:05,004 --> 00:30:06,839
UM, THAT THE POSTMORTEM
STAB WOUNDS

530
00:30:06,839 --> 00:30:08,074
BARELY BROKE
THE SURFACE.

531
00:30:08,074 --> 00:30:09,808
THEY WERE TENTATIVE.

532
00:30:18,918 --> 00:30:20,186
OK, THAT'S IT.

533
00:30:20,186 --> 00:30:21,520
ONCE THEY PUT IT
ALL TOGETHER,

534
00:30:21,520 --> 00:30:23,789
THEY'LL DECIDE THAT,
GIVEN THE SLOPPY NATURE

535
00:30:23,789 --> 00:30:24,924
OF THE CRIME SCENE--

536
00:30:24,924 --> 00:30:26,859
THE POSTMORTEM
MUTILATION--

537
00:30:26,859 --> 00:30:28,627
THE PROFILE WILL LEAN
TOWARDS THAT

538
00:30:28,627 --> 00:30:30,729
OF A DISORGANIZED
OFFENDER.

539
00:30:30,729 --> 00:30:31,931
POOR SOCIAL SKILLS.

540
00:30:31,931 --> 00:30:34,600
Justin:
NOCTURNAL BY NATURE.

541
00:30:34,600 --> 00:30:37,136
PROBABLY
INTO PORNOGRAPHY.

542
00:30:37,136 --> 00:30:39,005
Justin: ABOVE AVERAGE
INTELLIGENCE, BUT UNEDUCATED.

543
00:30:39,005 --> 00:30:40,172
LIVES ALONE.

544
00:30:40,172 --> 00:30:41,673
LIMITED RELATIONS
WITH WOMEN.

545
00:30:41,673 --> 00:30:45,244
ATTACK WAS SPONTANEOUS.

546
00:30:45,244 --> 00:30:47,179
UNPLANNED.

547
00:30:47,179 --> 00:30:48,680
EXCEPT, HE DIDN'T
DRIVE DOWN CLOSE

548
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:50,649
TO THE DUMP SPOT.

549
00:30:50,649 --> 00:30:52,919
THAT IS PLANNING.

550
00:30:52,919 --> 00:30:55,621
BUT HE LEFT
THE FOOTPRINTS.

551
00:30:55,621 --> 00:30:58,157
NONE OF THE PHYSICAL EVIDENCE
WILL LEAD TO THE SUSPECT,

552
00:30:58,157 --> 00:31:00,326
BUT THEY WILL DAMN HIM
WHEN HE IS DISCOVERED.

553
00:31:00,326 --> 00:31:02,461
WHEN WILL THEY
HAVE A SUSPECT?

554
00:31:02,461 --> 00:31:03,930
THEY SHOULD BE
EATING OUT OF OUR HANDS

555
00:31:03,930 --> 00:31:05,197
RIGHT ABOUT NOW.

556
00:31:05,197 --> 00:31:07,833
Richard: POOR RAY.
HE'LL NEVER SEE IT COMING.

557
00:31:07,833 --> 00:31:09,535
CASSIE,
LOOK AT THIS.

558
00:31:12,638 --> 00:31:13,805
"VIGI BOOTS."

559
00:31:13,805 --> 00:31:16,075
WHAT THE HELL
ARE VIGI BOOTS?

560
00:31:18,210 --> 00:31:20,779
THERE HE IS,
IN THE BLACK COAT.

561
00:31:20,779 --> 00:31:22,581
DON'T LET HIM
CHARM YOU TOO MUCH.

562
00:31:23,682 --> 00:31:24,883
RICHARD HAYWOOD?

563
00:31:28,354 --> 00:31:29,555
CASSIE MAYWEATHER,
SAM KENNEDY.

564
00:31:29,555 --> 00:31:30,422
SAN BENITO POLICE.

565
00:31:30,422 --> 00:31:32,791
CAN WE TALK TO YOU
FOR A MINUTE?

566
00:31:32,791 --> 00:31:34,160
YEAH, SURE.

567
00:31:38,264 --> 00:31:39,265
SO, YOU'RE WILLING
TO SPEAK TO US

568
00:31:39,265 --> 00:31:41,700
WITHOUT AN ATTORNEY
PRESENT?

569
00:31:41,700 --> 00:31:42,901
SURE.

570
00:31:44,236 --> 00:31:46,438
WHERE WERE YOU
LAST THURSDAY NIGHT?

571
00:31:49,641 --> 00:31:51,910
YOU THINK YOU COULD
TELL ME WHAT THIS IS ABOUT?

572
00:31:51,910 --> 00:31:53,445
WE'LL GET TO THAT.
JUST ANSWER THE QUESTION.

573
00:31:53,445 --> 00:31:57,183
I WAS CRAMMING FOR THIS
CALCULUS MID-TERM.

574
00:31:57,183 --> 00:31:58,717
I WAS WITH
A STUDY GROUP.

575
00:31:58,717 --> 00:31:59,952
HOW LONG?

576
00:31:59,952 --> 00:32:03,722
FROM ABOUT 7:00
UNTIL 3:00 FRIDAY MORNING.

577
00:32:03,722 --> 00:32:05,724
THAT'S QUITE
A CRAM SESSION.

578
00:32:05,724 --> 00:32:07,960
YEAH, WELL...

579
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,428
YOU KNOW, I GOT
KIND OF A SPOTTY RECORD.

580
00:32:09,428 --> 00:32:12,431
I GOT TO KEEP MY GRADES UP
FOR COLLEGE.

581
00:32:18,337 --> 00:32:20,706
CAN YOU GIVE US THE NAMES
OF THE OTHER PEOPLE THERE?

582
00:32:20,706 --> 00:32:23,275
YEAH. SURE.

583
00:32:23,275 --> 00:32:24,943
AM I IN SOME KIND
OF TROUBLE?

584
00:32:24,943 --> 00:32:26,412
YOU SEEM VERY PARTICULAR

585
00:32:26,412 --> 00:32:28,480
ABOUT YOUR APPEARANCE,
RICHARD.

586
00:32:30,349 --> 00:32:32,251
THANKS.

587
00:32:32,251 --> 00:32:34,253
I LIKE YOUR OUTFIT, TOO.

588
00:32:35,154 --> 00:32:37,656
SHE LOOKS GOOD.
IT'S LIKE, UH--LIKE, UH...

589
00:32:37,656 --> 00:32:41,227
FEMININE, BUT IT STILL
MANAGES TO BE PROFESSIONAL.

590
00:32:41,227 --> 00:32:43,595
IS THAT LIKE, A--
LIKE, A PLEATHER?

591
00:32:43,595 --> 00:32:46,432
KMART.

592
00:32:46,432 --> 00:32:48,267
WHAT WE'RE INTERESTED IN
IS YOUR SHOES, RICHARD.

593
00:32:48,267 --> 00:32:50,902
LET'S TALK
ABOUT THESE.

594
00:32:50,902 --> 00:32:52,638
VIGIs?

595
00:32:52,638 --> 00:32:55,041
YOU OWN A PAIR
OF THESE?

596
00:32:55,041 --> 00:32:56,308
UH...

597
00:32:56,308 --> 00:32:58,077
YOU BOUGHT THEM
AT, UH, SCARLATTI'S,

598
00:32:58,077 --> 00:33:01,947
DOWNTOWN SANTA BARBARA,
FOR $637.50...

599
00:33:01,947 --> 00:33:05,351
ON YOUR PLATINUM
BANK CARD.

600
00:33:05,351 --> 00:33:07,186
SIZE 12-D.

601
00:33:09,488 --> 00:33:12,624
THIS CAN'T BE
ABOUT MY SHOES.

602
00:33:12,624 --> 00:33:14,160
Cassie: WHY NOT?

603
00:33:15,394 --> 00:33:18,697
THIS IS ABOUT
MY SHOES?

604
00:33:18,697 --> 00:33:20,899
[CHUCKLES]

605
00:33:20,899 --> 00:33:22,234
WHEW.

606
00:33:22,234 --> 00:33:24,436
YOU GOT ME FREAKED OUT
LIKE I DID SOMETHING.

607
00:33:24,436 --> 00:33:25,704
JEEZ.

608
00:33:25,704 --> 00:33:27,239
DID YOU FIND THEM
OR WHAT?

609
00:33:29,108 --> 00:33:30,842
I REPORTED THEM
STOLEN FROM MY LOCKER,

610
00:33:30,842 --> 00:33:32,411
LIKE, 3 WEEKS AGO.

611
00:33:32,411 --> 00:33:35,447
I EVEN FILED A REPORT
WITH THE FRONT OFFICE.

612
00:33:37,549 --> 00:33:39,318
WELL, DID YOU FIND
THOSE SHOES OR NOT?

613
00:33:42,121 --> 00:33:44,156
OH, YOU KNOW WHAT?

614
00:33:44,156 --> 00:33:46,158
I THINK YOU SHOULD
TELL ME WHAT'S GOING ON.

615
00:33:46,158 --> 00:33:49,061
'CAUSE I'M...
SPINNING OUT HERE.

616
00:33:49,061 --> 00:33:50,996
SHOE PRINTS MATCHING THESE
WERE FOUND

617
00:33:50,996 --> 00:33:52,898
AT THE SCENE
OF A MURDER LAST WEEK.

618
00:33:52,898 --> 00:33:55,634
WHAT, THE COVINGTON WOMAN?

619
00:33:55,634 --> 00:33:56,802
THAT'S RIGHT.

620
00:33:56,802 --> 00:33:58,870
SO, YOU THINK THAT THE PERSON
THAT STOLE MY SHOES

621
00:33:58,870 --> 00:34:01,807
COMMITTED THIS MURDER?

622
00:34:01,807 --> 00:34:03,275
WELL, I WANT YOU TO KNOW
THAT I'M GONNA COOPERATE

623
00:34:03,275 --> 00:34:04,876
IN ANY WAY THAT I CAN.

624
00:34:04,876 --> 00:34:05,877
YOU HAVE
ANY IDEA WHO MIGHT

625
00:34:05,877 --> 00:34:07,079
HAVE STOLEN
YOUR BOOTS?

626
00:34:07,079 --> 00:34:08,614
NO, I DON'T.

627
00:34:08,614 --> 00:34:10,282
I WISH I DID NOW, THOUGH.
HEH HEH.

628
00:34:10,282 --> 00:34:11,517
ANY ENEMIES
AT SCHOOL?

629
00:34:11,517 --> 00:34:14,086
OH, WELL,
IT'S HIGH SCHOOL.

630
00:34:14,086 --> 00:34:16,054
WHAT DOES THAT MEAN?

631
00:34:16,054 --> 00:34:17,556
COME ON.
I DON'T WANT TO SOUND ARROGANT,

632
00:34:17,556 --> 00:34:19,057
BUT THERE'S PEOPLE
AT THIS SCHOOL

633
00:34:19,057 --> 00:34:20,092
WHO ENVY ME.

634
00:34:20,092 --> 00:34:21,427
REALLY?

635
00:34:21,427 --> 00:34:22,228
YEAH.

636
00:34:22,228 --> 00:34:24,196
WHY WOULD THEY
DO THAT?

637
00:34:25,131 --> 00:34:28,467
WELL, LET'S JUST SAY
THAT I'M VERY FORTUNATE,

638
00:34:28,467 --> 00:34:32,037
AND I'VE BEEN BLESSED
IN MANY WAYS.

639
00:34:32,037 --> 00:34:34,906
MUST BE NICE
BEING YOU, RICHARD.

640
00:34:34,906 --> 00:34:36,742
I GOT NO COMPLAINTS.

641
00:34:38,344 --> 00:34:40,112
IT ALL CHECKED OUT.

642
00:34:40,112 --> 00:34:41,280
HE FILED A REPORT
ABOUT THE BOOTS,

643
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:42,648
JUST LIKE HE SAID,

644
00:34:42,648 --> 00:34:44,049
AND HE MADE A PRETTY BIG
FUSS ABOUT IT,

645
00:34:44,049 --> 00:34:45,517
ACCORDING
TO THE PRINCIPAL.

646
00:34:45,517 --> 00:34:47,686
YEAH, I BET HE WAS
A PAIN IN THE ASS.

647
00:34:49,455 --> 00:34:51,089
WELL, SHE DIDN'T
SAY ANYTHING LIKE THAT.

648
00:34:51,089 --> 00:34:52,023
NO, BELIEVE ME.

649
00:34:52,023 --> 00:34:54,226
I HATE KIDS LIKE THAT.

650
00:34:54,226 --> 00:34:55,694
LIKE WHAT?

651
00:34:59,097 --> 00:35:00,166
CASSIE...

652
00:35:00,166 --> 00:35:02,201
WHAT ABOUT
THE STUDY SESSION?

653
00:35:03,535 --> 00:35:05,937
6 KIDS--6 KIDS WERE
AT HIS HOUSE WITH HIM,

654
00:35:05,937 --> 00:35:09,441
UH, FROM APPROXIMATELY
7:00, 7:30 THURSDAY EVENING

655
00:35:09,441 --> 00:35:11,777
TILL 3:00 A.M. FRIDAY.

656
00:35:11,777 --> 00:35:12,811
I TALKED TO ALL OF THEM.

657
00:35:12,811 --> 00:35:14,246
THEY ALL SAID HE WAS THERE
THE WHOLE TIME,

658
00:35:14,246 --> 00:35:15,581
EXCEPT FOR 15 MINUTES,

659
00:35:15,581 --> 00:35:17,649
WHEN HE WENT TO A LOCAL
ATM TO GET CASH

660
00:35:17,649 --> 00:35:18,917
FOR SOME PIZZA
THEY'D ORDERED.

661
00:35:18,917 --> 00:35:19,951
DID YOU CHECK THAT OUT?

662
00:35:19,951 --> 00:35:24,790
YEAH, HE WITHDREW $40
AT 9:19.

663
00:35:28,260 --> 00:35:29,995
GET THAT ENHANCED.

664
00:35:29,995 --> 00:35:31,129
WHY?

665
00:35:31,129 --> 00:35:33,365
BECAUSE I CAN'T
SEE HIS FACE.

666
00:35:33,365 --> 00:35:35,066
WELL, IT'S HIM.

667
00:35:35,066 --> 00:35:38,136
I CAN'T SEE HIS FACE.

668
00:35:40,339 --> 00:35:42,641
YOU REALLY THINK HE HAD
ANYTHING TO DO WITH THIS?

669
00:35:42,641 --> 00:35:43,642
I DON'T KNOW.

670
00:35:43,642 --> 00:35:46,578
BUT SOMETHING'S
NOT RIGHT WITH THAT KID.

671
00:35:47,913 --> 00:35:49,681
WELL, LOOK,
15 MINUTES--

672
00:35:49,681 --> 00:35:51,750
IT DOESN'T GIVE HIM
ENOUGH TIME.

673
00:35:51,750 --> 00:35:53,652
HE'S GOT TO DRIVE UP
TO COVINGTON, KILL THE WOMAN,

674
00:35:53,652 --> 00:35:55,921
DUMP HER BODY IN MARIPOSAS
WOODS AND GET BACK.

675
00:35:55,921 --> 00:35:57,689
HE'D NEED AT LEAST AN HOUR.

676
00:36:10,736 --> 00:36:13,472
[CLINKING]

677
00:36:29,455 --> 00:36:30,856
THEY QUESTIONED ME.

678
00:36:30,856 --> 00:36:31,857
AND?

679
00:36:31,857 --> 00:36:33,359
AND IT WAS SO COOL.

680
00:36:33,359 --> 00:36:34,893
DID THEY
GO FOR THE SHOES?

681
00:36:34,893 --> 00:36:36,595
OH, THEY GRABBED IT.

682
00:36:36,595 --> 00:36:38,997
I WAS SO GOOD.
I REALLY WAS. LISTEN...

683
00:36:38,997 --> 00:36:41,199
Richard, on tape: THIS
CAN'T BE ABOUT MY SHOES.

684
00:36:41,199 --> 00:36:42,301
Cassie: WHY NOT?

685
00:36:42,301 --> 00:36:43,469
Richard:
DID YOU FIND THEM OR WHAT?

686
00:36:43,469 --> 00:36:45,471
YOU SURE THEY DIDN'T
SUSPECT ANYTHING?

687
00:36:45,471 --> 00:36:47,539
I MEAN,
YOU DIDN'T OVERDO IT?

688
00:36:49,007 --> 00:36:50,609
A LITTLE BIT.

689
00:36:50,609 --> 00:36:53,745
I OVERDID IT
A LITTLE BIT.

690
00:36:53,745 --> 00:36:55,447
Richard: SO, YOU THINK THAT
THE PERSON THAT STOLE MY SHOES

691
00:36:55,447 --> 00:36:57,816
COMMITTED THIS MURDER?

692
00:36:57,816 --> 00:37:00,452
WELL, I WANT YOU TO KNOW
THAT I'M GONNA COOPERATE

693
00:37:00,452 --> 00:37:02,854
IN ANY WAY THAT I CAN.

694
00:37:02,854 --> 00:37:04,456
YOU KNOW?
[LAUGHS]

695
00:37:04,456 --> 00:37:05,591
MEET ME AT THE BLUFF
TONIGHT.

696
00:37:05,591 --> 00:37:06,958
I'M GONNA TELL YOU
ALL ABOUT IT.

697
00:37:06,958 --> 00:37:08,560
OH, I CAN'T.

698
00:37:12,097 --> 00:37:13,299
WHY NOT?

699
00:37:13,299 --> 00:37:16,134
I--I HAVE
SOMETHING TO DO.

700
00:37:16,134 --> 00:37:17,303
LIKE WHAT?

701
00:37:17,303 --> 00:37:21,273
I'LL TELL YOU LATER.
I--I SHOULD...

702
00:37:27,846 --> 00:37:29,515
DO YOU KNOW WHO
THIS KID'S FATHER IS?

703
00:37:29,515 --> 00:37:31,283
Cassie: I DON'T GIVE A SHIT.
I WANT TO SEARCH THE HOUSE.

704
00:37:31,283 --> 00:37:32,651
LAWRENCE HAYWOOD.

705
00:37:32,651 --> 00:37:34,353
HE BUILT
THE HILLSDALE MALL.

706
00:37:34,353 --> 00:37:36,221
BIG CAMPAIGN
CONTRIBUTOR, ROD?

707
00:37:36,221 --> 00:37:37,523
THAT'S RIGHT, CASSIE.

708
00:37:37,523 --> 00:37:39,157
AND I AM NOT ABOUT
TO FUCK WITH A GUY LIKE THAT

709
00:37:39,157 --> 00:37:40,559
ON ANYTHING AS FLIMSY
AS THIS.

710
00:37:40,559 --> 00:37:43,295
I'VE GROWN MUCH TOO FOND
OF MY OWN ASS TO DO ANYTHING

711
00:37:43,295 --> 00:37:44,763
THAT GODDAMN STUPID.

712
00:37:44,763 --> 00:37:45,997
[SIGHS]

713
00:37:47,165 --> 00:37:48,500
AND WHAT
IS YOUR PROBLEM?

714
00:37:50,135 --> 00:37:52,270
Rod: WHERE ARE YOU
ON THIS, SAM?

715
00:37:54,440 --> 00:37:56,608
I DON'T CARE WHO
HIS FATHER IS, EITHER.

716
00:37:56,608 --> 00:37:58,009
THAT'S NOT
WHAT I'M ASKING.

717
00:37:58,009 --> 00:38:01,613
DO YOU THINK WE HAVE ENOUGH
TO GO AFTER THIS KID?

718
00:38:04,883 --> 00:38:06,284
NO.

719
00:38:06,284 --> 00:38:07,419
AND IF WE
GO IN TOO SOON,

720
00:38:07,419 --> 00:38:08,854
I THINK WE COULD
BURN THE WHOLE CASE.

721
00:38:08,854 --> 00:38:11,256
OH, REALLY?
AND WHY IS THAT, VICE?

722
00:38:11,256 --> 00:38:12,758
Swanson: LOOK, I DON'T THINK
THERE'S A JUDGE IN THE COUNTY

723
00:38:12,758 --> 00:38:14,593
WHO'S GONNA SIGN A WARRANT
ON THE BASIS OF--

724
00:38:14,593 --> 00:38:16,595
OH, YOU KNOW WHAT?
SHUT UP, SWANSON.

725
00:38:16,595 --> 00:38:18,096
LOOK, ROD,
I'M TELLING YOU THIS KID

726
00:38:18,096 --> 00:38:19,164
WITH HIS DICK HEAD
ATTITUDE AND--

727
00:38:19,164 --> 00:38:20,466
LOOK, HIS ATTITUDE
ISN'T A CRIME.

728
00:38:20,466 --> 00:38:22,200
IT IS AN INDICATOR.
IT'S A PERSONALITY TYPE

729
00:38:22,200 --> 00:38:23,201
THAT'S VERY CAPABLE
OF DOING--

730
00:38:23,201 --> 00:38:24,436
HE DOESN'T FIT
THE PROFILE--

731
00:38:24,436 --> 00:38:26,338
YEAH, THE PROFILE
DOESN'T FIT THE PROFILE!

732
00:38:26,338 --> 00:38:27,873
THE KILLER
HAS ENOUGH SMARTS

733
00:38:27,873 --> 00:38:29,641
NOT TO DRIVE THE CAR
DOWN TO THE DUMP SITE,

734
00:38:29,641 --> 00:38:30,976
THE FORESIGHT TO STEAL
RICHARD'S BOOTS

735
00:38:30,976 --> 00:38:32,478
AND USE THEM INSTEAD OF
HIS OWN, BUT THE ATTACK

736
00:38:32,478 --> 00:38:33,612
WAS SPONTANEOUS
AND UNPLANNED?

737
00:38:33,612 --> 00:38:34,613
OK, BUT
IF YOU'RE RIGHT

738
00:38:34,613 --> 00:38:35,881
AND WE PUSH
TOO SOON--

739
00:38:35,881 --> 00:38:37,816
ROD, WHOSE CASE IS THIS?
WHOSE CASE IS THIS?

740
00:38:37,816 --> 00:38:38,884
CALM DOWN, PLEASE.

741
00:38:38,884 --> 00:38:40,386
NO, I'VE BEEN TRYING
TO FIND OLIVIA'S KILLER.

742
00:38:40,386 --> 00:38:41,453
OK? I'M BUSTING MY ASS
NIGHT AND DAY--

743
00:38:41,453 --> 00:38:44,155
OLIVIA?
WHO THE HELL IS OLIVIA?

744
00:38:44,155 --> 00:38:45,491
THE VICTIM.

745
00:38:45,491 --> 00:38:46,625
IS THIS STILL
MY INVESTIGATION?

746
00:38:46,625 --> 00:38:48,627
IT'S A COORDINATED EFFORT.

747
00:38:48,627 --> 00:38:51,997
YOU'RE GETTING WAY
TOO INVOLVED IN THIS, CASSIE.

748
00:38:55,333 --> 00:38:56,234
CASSIE?

749
00:38:56,234 --> 00:38:57,302
WHAT?

750
00:38:57,302 --> 00:38:58,970
YOU CALLED HER
BY HER FIRST NAME.

751
00:38:58,970 --> 00:39:00,205
I'M SORRY. WHAT?

752
00:39:00,205 --> 00:39:02,908
YOU SAID, "I'VE BEEN TRYING
TO FIND OLIVIA'S KILLER."

753
00:39:02,908 --> 00:39:04,976
NO, I DIDN'T.

754
00:39:07,112 --> 00:39:08,113
DID I?

755
00:39:08,113 --> 00:39:10,215
YEAH, YOU DID.

756
00:39:10,215 --> 00:39:12,951
YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO BE
IDENTIFYING WITH THE KILLER,

757
00:39:12,951 --> 00:39:14,386
NOT THE VICTIM.

758
00:39:16,922 --> 00:39:18,457
YOU REMEMBER THAT?

759
00:39:20,025 --> 00:39:21,460
[DOOR SLAMS]

760
00:39:23,328 --> 00:39:27,098
Matlock, on TV: YOU DON'T HAVE
ANY WITNESSES OR FINGERPRINTS

761
00:39:27,098 --> 00:39:28,567
OR POWDER BURNS OR...

762
00:39:28,567 --> 00:39:30,201
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

763
00:39:30,201 --> 00:39:35,106
Man, on TV: TOBIAS ALWAYS
KEPT A GUN RIGHT HERE.

764
00:39:35,106 --> 00:39:36,174
LOADED.

765
00:39:36,174 --> 00:39:37,543
CAN I COME IN?

766
00:39:37,543 --> 00:39:39,545
WITHIN EASY REACH OF ANYBODY
SITTING AT THIS DESK.

767
00:39:39,545 --> 00:39:41,913
[LOWERS VOLUME]

768
00:39:45,517 --> 00:39:47,786
LISTEN--
LISTEN, I'M SORRY

769
00:39:47,786 --> 00:39:49,621
I DIDN'T BACK YOU UP
IN THERE.

770
00:39:49,621 --> 00:39:50,989
HEY, I'M A BIG GIRL.

771
00:39:50,989 --> 00:39:53,158
YOU SAID WHAT
YOU THOUGHT, RIGHT?

772
00:39:53,158 --> 00:39:54,426
YES, BUT IT--

773
00:39:54,426 --> 00:39:56,027
WELL, THEN,
YOU DID THE RIGHT THING.

774
00:39:57,629 --> 00:39:58,830
YOU KNOW, WE CAN'T
JUST BUST IN THERE--

775
00:39:58,830 --> 00:40:01,332
YEAH, I KNOW.
I HEARD YOU WITH ROD.

776
00:40:01,332 --> 00:40:03,234
SO, CAN YOU GET
OUT OF THE WAY?

777
00:40:03,234 --> 00:40:05,403
YOU KNOW WHAT
YOUR PROBLEM IS?

778
00:40:05,403 --> 00:40:06,738
YEAH, IT'S THAT
YOU'RE BLOCKING MATLOCK.

779
00:40:06,738 --> 00:40:08,106
NOW CAN YOU GET
OUT OF THE WAY?

780
00:40:08,106 --> 00:40:09,307
PLEASE?

781
00:40:09,307 --> 00:40:11,677
I'M JUST--I'M TRYING
TO APOLOGIZE HERE.

782
00:40:14,312 --> 00:40:15,380
ALL RIGHT.

783
00:40:15,380 --> 00:40:17,182
APOLOGY ACCEPTED.

784
00:40:19,017 --> 00:40:20,452
YOU WANT TO SIT DOWN?

785
00:40:23,021 --> 00:40:24,656
WANT TO HAVE A COOKIE?

786
00:40:46,011 --> 00:40:48,013
HI.
HI.

787
00:40:53,384 --> 00:40:55,020
WHAT'S GOING ON?

788
00:40:55,020 --> 00:40:58,456
MMM, I'M MAKING UP.

789
00:40:58,456 --> 00:41:00,091
WE'RE STILL FRIENDS, RIGHT?

790
00:41:00,091 --> 00:41:01,893
WHAT--WHAT'S THIS?

791
00:41:01,893 --> 00:41:04,029
I DON'T KNOW.
LET'S FIND OUT.

792
00:41:04,029 --> 00:41:04,996
SO, WHAT HAPPENS?

793
00:41:04,996 --> 00:41:06,498
WE DO THIS AND YOU
THROW ME OUT AGAIN?

794
00:41:06,498 --> 00:41:07,899
OR YOU STAY.

795
00:41:07,899 --> 00:41:10,435
OR, THIS TIME, YOU LEAVE.
I DON'T KNOW.

796
00:41:10,435 --> 00:41:13,071
IT'S REALLY HARD TO TELL
IN ADVANCE.

797
00:41:13,071 --> 00:41:15,707
WHAT DO YOU WANT, HUH?
YOU WANT--YOU WANT PROMISES?

798
00:41:15,707 --> 00:41:16,942
YOU WANT A RING?

799
00:41:16,942 --> 00:41:19,144
IS THAT WHAT YOU WANT?
DO YOU WANT A RING?

800
00:41:19,144 --> 00:41:20,646
DON'T.
ALL RIGHT?

801
00:41:22,080 --> 00:41:24,282
LOOK, IT'S NOT JUST
ABOUT SEX. OK?

802
00:41:24,282 --> 00:41:26,652
I REALLY RESPECT YOU
AS A PERSON.

803
00:41:29,387 --> 00:41:30,656
IS THAT WHAT YOU--

804
00:41:32,591 --> 00:41:34,192
WHY DO YOU ALWAYS
WANT TO HURT PEOPLE?

805
00:41:34,192 --> 00:41:36,528
I WOULDN'T SAY ALWAYS.

806
00:41:36,528 --> 00:41:38,296
IT JUST KIND OF HAPPENS
SOMETIMES.

807
00:41:38,296 --> 00:41:41,432
YOU--YOU'RE SO--
YOU'RE SO GOOD

808
00:41:41,432 --> 00:41:43,101
AT BREAKING
OTHER PEOPLE DOWN.

809
00:41:43,101 --> 00:41:46,271
BUT YOU NEVER STOP
AND TAKE A LOOK AT YOURSELF.

810
00:41:59,450 --> 00:42:01,620
THE NEIGHBOR
HEARD 2 SHOTS.

811
00:42:01,620 --> 00:42:05,356
ONLY ONE SLUG
WAS EVER FOUND.

812
00:42:05,356 --> 00:42:06,491
THE OTHER--

813
00:42:06,491 --> 00:42:07,826
[SHUTS OFF TV]

814
00:42:40,258 --> 00:42:41,159
ALL RIGHT.

815
00:42:41,159 --> 00:42:43,094
[GIGGLES]
WHERE ARE YOU TAKING ME?

816
00:42:43,094 --> 00:42:46,297
NO PEEKING.
WE'RE ALMOST THERE.

817
00:42:46,297 --> 00:42:47,899
STEP UP.

818
00:42:51,870 --> 00:42:53,404
OK.

819
00:42:53,404 --> 00:42:55,006
OPEN YOUR EYES.

820
00:42:56,675 --> 00:43:00,145
OH, MY GOD.
JUSTIN, THIS IS BEAUTIFUL.

821
00:43:02,748 --> 00:43:04,182
DID YOU GROW THESE?

822
00:43:12,423 --> 00:43:14,192
WHAT HAPPENED?
YOU'RE DIFFERENT.

823
00:43:15,794 --> 00:43:17,996
YEAH, I AM DIFFERENT.

824
00:43:30,709 --> 00:43:33,278
[TELEPHONE RINGS]

825
00:43:37,015 --> 00:43:39,617
[RING]

826
00:43:40,719 --> 00:43:42,688
MAYWEATHER.

827
00:43:42,688 --> 00:43:44,022
HELLO?

828
00:43:44,022 --> 00:43:45,423
Operator: YOU HAVE A COLLECT
CALL FROM AN INMATE

829
00:43:45,423 --> 00:43:47,793
IN THE CALIFORNIA DEPARTMENT
OF CORRECTIONS FACILITY.

830
00:43:47,793 --> 00:43:49,494
THE NAME
OF THE INMATE IS...

831
00:43:49,494 --> 00:43:50,729
CARL HUDSON.

832
00:43:50,729 --> 00:43:52,898
IF YOU WISH
TO ACCEPT, PRESS--

833
00:43:56,702 --> 00:43:59,404
[RING]

834
00:44:03,408 --> 00:44:06,611
[RING]

835
00:44:06,611 --> 00:44:08,246
I DO NOT WISH TO ACCEPT
ANY CALLS FROM--

836
00:44:08,246 --> 00:44:09,347
CASSIE?

837
00:44:09,347 --> 00:44:11,016
WHAT?

838
00:44:11,016 --> 00:44:12,317
IT'S SAM.

839
00:44:12,317 --> 00:44:14,419
HEY. HI.
I'M SORRY.

840
00:44:14,419 --> 00:44:16,121
UM, WHAT CAN I DO
FOR YOU?

841
00:44:16,121 --> 00:44:19,390
REMEMBER THE PUKE
AT THE BODY DUMP?

842
00:44:19,390 --> 00:44:20,525
YEAH.

843
00:44:20,525 --> 00:44:22,060
WELL, MOST OF IT
WAS UNIDENTIFIABLE,

844
00:44:22,060 --> 00:44:24,262
BUT, UH, KEVIN
MANAGED TO ISOLATE

845
00:44:24,262 --> 00:44:27,365
WHAT TURNED OUT TO BE
PARTIALLY DIGESTED EGGS.

846
00:44:27,365 --> 00:44:28,366
FISH EGGS.

847
00:44:28,366 --> 00:44:29,500
OH, YOU MEAN CAVIAR?

848
00:44:29,500 --> 00:44:30,635
YEAH, APPARENTLY SO.

849
00:44:30,635 --> 00:44:31,703
ANYWAY,
I COMPILED A LIST

850
00:44:31,703 --> 00:44:33,038
OF ALL THE LOCAL
RESTAURANTS

851
00:44:33,038 --> 00:44:35,440
AND VENDORS
THAT SELL CAVIAR.

852
00:44:39,677 --> 00:44:41,379
"MAISON SAINT CROIX."

853
00:44:41,379 --> 00:44:42,380
WHAT WAS HIS NAME
AGAIN?

854
00:44:42,380 --> 00:44:44,415
RICHARD HAYWOOD.

855
00:44:44,415 --> 00:44:45,717
MILES HAYWOOD'S KID?

856
00:44:45,717 --> 00:44:47,252
HE CAME IN HERE ONCE
AROUND CHRISTMAS

857
00:44:47,252 --> 00:44:48,153
WITH HIS PARENTS.

858
00:44:48,153 --> 00:44:49,620
NOT LAST WEEK?
WEDNESDAY? THURSDAY?

859
00:44:49,620 --> 00:44:50,956
I HARDLY EVER SEE
ANY HIGH SCHOOL KIDS

860
00:44:50,956 --> 00:44:52,623
IN HERE
DURING THE WEEK.

861
00:44:52,623 --> 00:44:53,725
EXCEPT JUSTIN PENDLETON.

862
00:44:53,725 --> 00:44:55,060
WHO'S JUSTIN PENDLETON?

863
00:44:55,060 --> 00:44:56,427
HE USED TO COME IN WITH
HIS FATHER ALL THE TIME,

864
00:44:56,427 --> 00:44:58,830
BUT I THINK
HIS PARENTS SPLIT UP.

865
00:44:58,830 --> 00:45:00,732
NOW HE COMES IN
BY HIMSELF.

866
00:45:00,732 --> 00:45:02,467
HE'S A SENIOR
OVER AT JEFFERSON.

867
00:45:02,467 --> 00:45:04,770
RICHARD HAYWOOD'S
A SENIOR OVER AT JEFFERSON.

868
00:45:04,770 --> 00:45:06,404
JUSTIN EATS HERE ALONE?

869
00:45:06,404 --> 00:45:08,106
HE ALWAYS BRINGS A BOOK.

870
00:45:08,106 --> 00:45:09,941
HE'S A BIT OF A LONER,
I'D SAY,

871
00:45:09,941 --> 00:45:11,109
BUT A BRILLIANT KID.

872
00:45:11,109 --> 00:45:12,778
YOU SHOULD
HEAR HIM TALK.

873
00:45:13,945 --> 00:45:16,081
WHEN WAS HE
IN HERE LAST?

874
00:45:18,784 --> 00:45:20,485
THE FIFTH.
7:30 P.M.

875
00:45:21,787 --> 00:45:23,421
WHAT TIME DID HE LEAVE?

876
00:45:23,421 --> 00:45:24,489
I'D SAY ABOUT 9:00.

877
00:45:24,489 --> 00:45:25,590
DO YOU KNOW WHAT HE ATE?

878
00:45:25,590 --> 00:45:27,058
DO YOU HAVE
THE COMPUTER RECORDS?

879
00:45:32,497 --> 00:45:34,132
JUSTIN...

880
00:45:34,132 --> 00:45:36,902
HI. CASSIE MAYWEATHER
WITH THE SAN BENITO POLICE.

881
00:45:38,904 --> 00:45:41,239
YOU'RE A...
POLICE OFFICER?

882
00:45:41,239 --> 00:45:43,341
I'M A HOMICIDE
INVESTIGATOR.

883
00:45:43,341 --> 00:45:44,876
THEY SAID AT SCHOOL
THAT I MIGHT FIND YOU HERE.

884
00:45:44,876 --> 00:45:46,677
CAN I ASK YOU
A COUPLE QUESTIONS?

885
00:45:46,677 --> 00:45:47,913
SURE.

886
00:45:47,913 --> 00:45:49,514
YOU HAD DINNER
AT THE MAISON SAINT CROIX

887
00:45:49,514 --> 00:45:50,949
ON THE FIFTH
OF THIS MONTH?

888
00:45:50,949 --> 00:45:53,251
[CORRECTING PRONUNCIATION]
MAISON SAINT CROIX.

889
00:45:53,251 --> 00:45:55,353
OH...THANK YOU.

890
00:45:55,353 --> 00:45:58,756
THE FIFTH WAS A THURSDAY,
AND THEY HAD A CAVIAR APPETIZER.

891
00:45:58,756 --> 00:46:00,591
DID YOU HAVE IT?

892
00:46:00,591 --> 00:46:04,262
UM...YEAH.
I--I MIGHT HAVE.

893
00:46:04,262 --> 00:46:06,731
CAN YOU TELL ME
WHAT HAPPENED?

894
00:46:06,731 --> 00:46:07,833
DO YOU KNOW
RICHARD HAYWOOD?

895
00:46:07,833 --> 00:46:10,435
EVERYONE KNOWS HIM.

896
00:46:10,435 --> 00:46:12,003
IS HE INVOLVED
IN THIS?

897
00:46:12,003 --> 00:46:13,471
IS HE A FRIEND
OF YOURS?

898
00:46:13,471 --> 00:46:14,840
NO.

899
00:46:14,840 --> 00:46:16,975
I MEAN, I--
I TUTORED HIM

900
00:46:16,975 --> 00:46:18,676
FOR HIS BIO S.A.T.
LAST YEAR,

901
00:46:18,676 --> 00:46:20,778
BUT I--WE'RE NOT...

902
00:46:21,712 --> 00:46:23,248
WE DON'T OWN
MUCH IN COMMON.

903
00:46:23,248 --> 00:46:24,115
HMM.

904
00:46:24,115 --> 00:46:25,650
ARE YOU
IN HIS STUDY GROUP?

905
00:46:25,650 --> 00:46:28,486
UH, NO.
WHAT STUDY GROUP?

906
00:46:28,486 --> 00:46:29,921
WHEN YOU LEFT
THE RESTAURANT ON THURSDAY,

907
00:46:29,921 --> 00:46:31,722
DID YOU TAKE
LEFTOVERS WITH YOU?

908
00:46:31,722 --> 00:46:32,891
NO.

909
00:46:32,891 --> 00:46:34,025
YOU DIDN'T TAKE
LEFTOVERS

910
00:46:34,025 --> 00:46:35,060
TO YOUR FRIENDS
AT THE STUDY GROUP?

911
00:46:35,060 --> 00:46:37,028
GIVE THEM
SOMETHING TO EAT?

912
00:46:37,028 --> 00:46:39,998
LOOK, I--I TOLD YOU.
I BARELY KNOW HIM.

913
00:46:39,998 --> 00:46:42,834
HE MAKES FUN OF ME
IN CLASS.

914
00:46:42,834 --> 00:46:44,435
WHY WOULD HE
DO THAT?

915
00:46:44,435 --> 00:46:47,238
'CAUSE, UM...
THAT'S WHAT HE'S LIKE.

916
00:46:47,238 --> 00:46:49,875
I MEAN, HE MAKES FUN
OF EVERYONE.

917
00:46:49,875 --> 00:46:52,343
HE'S ONE
OF THE COOL KIDS.

918
00:46:52,343 --> 00:46:55,246
WHAT MAKES HIM COOL?

919
00:46:55,246 --> 00:46:59,084
YOU KNOW.
HE'S SMART, HE'S RICH.

920
00:46:59,084 --> 00:47:01,252
HE'S WITTY
AND EVERYONE LIKES HIM.

921
00:47:01,252 --> 00:47:03,354
AND YOU DON'T?

922
00:47:03,354 --> 00:47:05,156
HMM.

923
00:47:05,156 --> 00:47:07,825
YEAH, I KNEW KIDS
LIKE THAT.

924
00:47:07,825 --> 00:47:10,295
SUPERSTARS OF HIGH SCHOOL.

925
00:47:10,295 --> 00:47:13,899
TRUST ME--5 YEARS FROM NOW,
NOBODY'LL CARE WHO THEY ARE.

926
00:47:14,900 --> 00:47:17,802
YEAH, WELL, RICHARD
WILL ALWAYS BE COOL.

927
00:47:17,802 --> 00:47:19,770
I MEAN,
HIS DADDY'S RICH.

928
00:47:19,770 --> 00:47:20,906
AND I HATE TO ADMIT IT,

929
00:47:20,906 --> 00:47:22,207
BUT HE'S ACTUALLY
PRETTY SMART.

930
00:47:22,207 --> 00:47:24,375
I MEAN, HE'S LAZY
AND HE DIDN'T STUDY,

931
00:47:24,375 --> 00:47:26,978
BUT HE STILL GOT, LIKE,
A 710 ON THAT BIO S.A.T.

932
00:47:26,978 --> 00:47:29,347
KIND OF SPUN ME OUT.
YOU KNOW?

933
00:47:29,347 --> 00:47:30,949
SPINNING OUT, HUH?

934
00:47:32,918 --> 00:47:34,719
YOU SEEM TO KNOW HIM
QUITE WELL, ACTUALLY.

935
00:47:34,719 --> 00:47:36,321
WELL, YOU CAN TELL

936
00:47:36,321 --> 00:47:38,089
JUST BY HIS BEHAVIOR
IN CLASS.

937
00:47:38,089 --> 00:47:40,391
[CELL PHONE RINGING]
SORRY.

938
00:47:42,793 --> 00:47:44,095
YEAH?
CASSIE, WHERE YOU BEEN?

939
00:47:44,095 --> 00:47:45,663
EVERYBODY'S
LOOKING FOR YOU.

940
00:47:45,663 --> 00:47:47,332
SAM I.D.'d THE SUSPECT.

941
00:47:47,332 --> 00:47:49,200
WHO IS IT?
IS HE IN CUSTODY?

942
00:47:49,200 --> 00:47:50,235
I DON'T KNOW.
ASK SAM.

943
00:47:50,235 --> 00:47:51,937
HE'S IN CHARGE
OF THE CASE NOW.

944
00:47:51,937 --> 00:47:54,906
S.I.D. IS OVER THERE NOW
COLLECTING EVIDENCE.

945
00:48:06,417 --> 00:48:07,785
HI, CASS.

946
00:48:07,785 --> 00:48:09,587
LOOK AT THIS, SIR.

947
00:48:10,688 --> 00:48:11,923
THAT COULD BE A MATCH.

948
00:48:11,923 --> 00:48:12,991
GOOD--LOG THAT.

949
00:48:12,991 --> 00:48:14,592
I WANT SAMPLES
OF FABRICS, SOILS,

950
00:48:14,592 --> 00:48:17,628
ANY MOLDS, PLANTS,
IN HERE AND OUTSIDE. OK?

951
00:48:17,628 --> 00:48:18,796
YES, SIR.
GOOD.

952
00:48:18,796 --> 00:48:19,864
HEY, JOHN'S FOUND
A SIGNIFICANT STASH

953
00:48:19,864 --> 00:48:21,332
OF MARIJUANA BUDS.

954
00:48:21,332 --> 00:48:23,434
YOU MIND IF WE
SMOKE UP WHILE WE WORK?

955
00:48:23,434 --> 00:48:24,469
YES, I DO.

956
00:48:24,469 --> 00:48:25,470
[SNICKERS]

957
00:48:28,606 --> 00:48:30,541
SO, WHO IS HE?

958
00:48:30,541 --> 00:48:31,977
RAYMOND LEE FEATHERS.

959
00:48:31,977 --> 00:48:34,179
HE'S A JANITOR
OVER AT JEFFERSON HIGH.

960
00:48:34,179 --> 00:48:36,147
YOU SEE, I COMPILED A LIST
OF EVERYONE AT THE SCHOOL,

961
00:48:36,147 --> 00:48:38,083
STUDENTS AND STAFF,
WHO MIGHT HAVE STOLEN

962
00:48:38,083 --> 00:48:39,484
RICHARD HAYWOOD'S BOOTS.

963
00:48:39,484 --> 00:48:42,220
THEN I CROSS-INDEXED THAT
AGAINST CARPET PURCHASES,

964
00:48:42,220 --> 00:48:44,155
AND OUT CAME THIS.

965
00:48:46,357 --> 00:48:49,160
APPARENTLY, HE SOLD GRASS
TO THE KIDS AT SCHOOL.

966
00:48:51,729 --> 00:48:52,964
GOOD WORK.

967
00:48:52,964 --> 00:48:54,332
THANK YOU.

968
00:48:54,332 --> 00:48:55,933
